sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Visitor
  participant C as Carousel
  participant A as AnalyticsEmitter
  participant GA as GA4

  V->>C: Toggle autoplay ON
  C->>C: Verify `prefers-reduced-motion` (allow)
  C->>A: emit testimonial_autoplay_toggled {enabled:true}
  A-->>GA: POST measurement payload
  C->>C: Start slide timer (8s)
  C-->>V: Advance to next testimonial after timer
  C->>A: emit testimonial_slide_view {testimonial_id:"mtb-anita", position:2, autoplay:true}
